{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Demon's Ascension","What happens when an outlaw teenager who grows up evil steps into the world of immortalism? Immortals and demons, life and death are not in the hands of heaven. Let's watch him swim upstream and become a legend in a world where people and demons stand side by side, and where demons and ghosts run rampant.\n\n\n\n(Source: iQIYI, translated)"],"ja":["魔天记",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-61566","ids":{"shikimori":61566,"mal":61566,"anilist":166419,"kodik":"serial-69257"},"kodikIds":["serial-69257"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-69257":"2025-09-16T21:13:25Z"},"title":"Дневник демона","originalTitle":"Mo Tian Ji","alt":"Demon's Ascension Demon's Ascension 魔天记","description":"Что произойдет, когда отчаявшийся мальчик, выросший среди злых людей, попадет в мир, где культивируют бессмертных? Бессмертных и демонов можно разделить одной мыслью, а жизнь и смерть определяются не небесами. Давайте посмотрим, как он пойдет против течения в этом мире, где сосуществуют люди и демоны, а злые духи свирепствуют, и станет легендой.","year":2025,"type":"ONA","genres":["Экшен","Приключения","Фэнтези","исторический","боевые искусства"],"rating":7.21,"popularity":574,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/61566/875e5049d6d8ff688385327ce7382a1e.jpeg","width":715,"height":990},"backdrop":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/system/screenshots/original/a225843068afb79e0edb3a984a27df9aad6ca7e6.jpg","width":1920,"height":1080}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-3857","dubId":"3857","label":"MDA","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-69257","translationId":"3857","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/seria/1491329/1309fb6d6cba7161eeab34c3741aaee1/